    ENG["155 engineered predictors<br/>cycle · 3 settings · regime<br/>15 sensors<br/>15 × 3 statistics × 3 windows"]:::output
    RAW["25 raw predictors<br/>cycle · 3 settings · 21 sensors"]:::output

    TRAIN --> SEL
    TRAIN --> KM
    ANY --> NORM --> ROLL --> ENG
    KM -. regimes and scalers .-> NORM
    SEL -. kept sensors .-> ROLL
    ANY -- raw variant --> RAW

